From 6ba6a244f238cea238995c7403dd6227334462c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rigaz29 <ryanbagas27@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 18:54:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: perbaiki nama modul AIDL powershare untuk basis
 22.2

Fork ULH merujuk "vendor.lineage.powershare-V1.0-java" (gaya penamaan lama).
hardware/lineage/interfaces resmi mendeklarasikan aidl_interface bernama
"vendor.lineage.powershare", sehingga soong menghasilkan
"vendor.lineage.powershare-V1-java".

Dua kemunculan, keduanya di packages/SystemUI/Android.bp.

Kelas yang sama dengan perbaikan libui di frameworks/native: fork ULH
lineage-22.2 (dorongan terakhir Mei 2026) tertinggal dari basis resmi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 packages/SystemUI/Android.bp | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/Android.bp b/packages/SystemUI/Android.bp
index bc219dd5abef..e5fc3d509c30 100644
--- a/packages/SystemUI/Android.bp
+++ b/packages/SystemUI/Android.bp
@@ -512,7 +512,7 @@ android_library {
         "androidx.activity_activity-compose",
         "androidx.compose.animation_animation-graphics",
         "androidx.lifecycle_lifecycle-viewmodel-compose",
-        "vendor.lineage.powershare-V1.0-java",
+        "vendor.lineage.powershare-V1-java",
     ],
     libs: [
         "keepanno-annotations",
@@ -695,7 +695,7 @@ android_library {
         "androidx.lifecycle_lifecycle-viewmodel-compose",
         "TraceurCommon",
         "Traceur-res",
-        "vendor.lineage.powershare-V1.0-java",
+        "vendor.lineage.powershare-V1-java",
     ],
 }
 
-- 
